s the new tolerance-cost experiment.\",\n        \"01a AND01b completed successfully with unchanged source and verified artifact hashes; immutable snapshot results\/reference\/20261107-wide-sampling. Each has20 static and36 service arms with consistent arrival accounting. Static no-index100-column COUNT6.8817-8.1966s vs sample0.7568-1.0313s; small-index COUNT0.0494-0.0723s vs sample1.1712-3.1946s. Under1s service budget,100-column sampling had6\/6 exhausted without small index and3\/6 exhausted with index. Do not call static speed an SLO pass.\",\n        \"Isolated3\/5\/10% comparison code has been prepared without changing running imports; see latestAccuracySteering. Syntax\/diff checks and pure band\/dependency checks pass; actual measurement is pending.\",\n        \"0d completed exit0,all sections present.0g completed exit0,all20arms\/five repeats\/windows present,no skipped arms or section errors. At10M rows,indexed-column updates310\/s,256MB pool, statement_k18.758-26.480s,statement_pk0.719-1.254s,split_pk2.307-2.405s. This counters any blanket small-secondary-index rule under MVCC\/write churn. Exact SQL forms\/settings and physical reads must be interpreted; do not attribute the whole difference solely to index size. Growing immutable-source snapshot at primaryCoverageSnapshotPath. Other0h-0l still running.\",\n        \"Root fixed a concrete new-frontier failure-loss path discovered during the read-only review: record_sample persists the sample before comparison, skips comparison on unexpected sample failure, and persists a comparison failure without losing the sample. Pure regression uses actual function AST and failed fake connections; results\/reviews\/accuracy-frontier-failure-regression.json passes. New bench\/test_accuracy_frontier.py should be added to lab.self_checks after current owner ends. The design-review immutable snapshot intentionally retains the pre-fix code; do not claim its final findings already closed without checking live correction.\